Looks like it discards the buffer and returns the passed error.
```
  int pldm_msgbuf_discard(struct pldm_msgbuf *ctx, int error)
  {
  |       ctx->cursor = NULL;
  |       pldm__msgbuf_invalidate(ctx);
  |       return error;
  }
```
